OL,3,AFaisal Islam: How high will interest
OL,4,Arates go?
OL,5,
OL,6,FInterest rates have risen to 4% and the
OL,7,FBank of England has indicated there are
OL,8,Fmore rises to come. The question is how
OL,9,Fmany? There is a split on the
OL,10,Frate-setting committee here.
OL,12,FThree of the nine voting members
OL,13,Freferred to "rises" plural. One member
OL,14,Fvoted for a bigger increase, to 4.25%.
OL,15,FThree referred to just one more
OL,16,Fincluding governor Andrew Bailey.
OL,18,FMy read on this is that the expectation
OL,19,Fis for one more rise in February. Two
OL,20,Fand done, but it depends.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
